      explanation: "Inheritance expresses an is-a relationship: a Mentor is a Learner with extra behavior. super() calls the parent implementation instead of duplicating its setup. Composition expresses has-a: a Course has a list of lessons. Good designs choose the simplest relationship that fits and avoid deep, fragile hierarchies.",
